.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-container-registry-get - Gyro image registry of the environment


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro container registry get  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Gyro image registry of the environment

.PP
Host, image prefix \fB<host>/<code>/\fR, username, usage (\fBused_gb\fR, \fBfree_gb\fR = 2, \fBbillable_gb\fR, \fBcap_gb\fR = 50), \fBpush_allowed\fR and the clean-up policy. Only this environment can push/pull its repositories. Above 2 GB: €0.05 per GB per month, charged hourly from the prepaid balance. The password is returned only by POST .../registry/credentials.

.PP
API: GET /cloud/containers/{id}/registry (operationId typed_get_containers\fBid\fPregistry, scope services_read)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for get


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	API base URL (env GYRO_API_URL)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	log HTTP requests to stderr (secrets masked)

.PP
\fB--lang\fP=""
	message language: tr or en (default from locale)

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	disable colours (also NO_COLOR)

.PP
\fB--no-header\fP[=false]
	omit the table header

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP=""
	output format: table, json, yaml, text

.PP
\fB-p\fP, \fB--profile\fP=""
	profile to use (env GYRO_PROFILE)

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath query applied to the result

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	print only ids

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=0s
	overall timeout, e.g. 30s, 10m

.PP
\fB--wide\fP[=false]
	show all table columns

.PP
\fB-y\fP, \fB--yes\fP[=false]
	do not ask for confirmation


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgyro-container-registry(1)\fP
